      {
        "id": 3913435294,
        "type": "DiffNote",
        "body": "Location: `src/craft/brew.c` `can_brew_spell()` lines 578-590.\n\nExploit/repro: Artificer 20 / Alchemist 1 with Artificer Item Creation. `artificer_can_emulate_spell()` is true for haste (wizard level 5, circle 3, device cap 4). `brew 'haste'` does not start. It prints `That spell is too high level for you to brew.` The alchemist branch runs first and compares the wizard minimum level, 5, with `CLASS_LEVEL(alchemist) / 3`, which is forced up to 1. Line 590 is never reached. One alchemist level removes device-spell brewing.\n\nFix: Accept the spell when `artificer_can_emulate_spell(ch, spell_num)` is true before applying the alchemist level cap. Keep that cap only for spells the artificer cannot emulate.",
        "author": {
          "id": 42759441,
          "username": "max757",
          "public_email": "",
          "name": "Max aka Mosheh",
          "state": "active",
          "locked": false,
