        "body": "Valid; fixed in 36953d692. `can_brew_spell()` now accepts the spell when `artificer_can_emulate_spell()` is true, after the offensive-spell refusal and before the alchemist level cap. The cap still applies to spells the artificer cannot emulate. `Test_artificer_brews_emulated_spells_without_slots` covers Artificer 20 / Alchemist 1 brewing haste: no \"too high level\" message, and the brew starts. The test fails on the old code.",
